<title>USA: US FAX names D'Cruz acting president.</title>
<headline>US FAX names D'Cruz acting president.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>US FAX Inc said Wednesday it had appointed A.W. D'Cruz as acting president, effective immediately.</p>
<p>D'Cruz was past president and chief operating officer of American Bank Note Holographics Inc. Prior to that he held various management positions at DuPont Co.</p>
